title: guard1
---
Analytical Guard: Hey friend. The name's Fergy.
Fergy: You plan to enter the ruins?
-> Yes
    Fergy: Well... good luck.
    Fergy: We didn't get far in. But for the areas we did get to, we were able to set waypoints back to the entrance should you need to return.
    Fergy: The bright green spots, you can't miss 'em.
    Fergy: No much... but it's something.

-> No
    Fergy: I don't blame ya.
    Fergy: If a whole army couldn't handle it. I don't see how one measley mercenary could fare better.
    Fergy: ...No offence.
